                <span class="info-val" style="position: relative;">Singaporean</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
              <div class="info-icon">🔍</div>
              <div>
                <span class="info-label" style="position: relative;">Peer Reviewer</span>
                <span class="info-val" style="position: relative;">Nature, Science Advances, Nature Communications, Joule, Advanced Materials, ACS Nano, etc.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div></div>
      <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-education">
        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="tl-dot" style="font-size:10px">USYD</div>
            <div class="tl-body">
              <p class="tl-year" style="position: relative;">2026 – Present</p>
              <p class="tl-degree" style="position: relative;">Research Affliate and Incoming Lecturer</p>
              <p class="tl-inst" style="position: relative;">University of Sydney, Sydney, Australia</p>
              <p class="tl-detail" style="position: relative;">School of Chemical &amp; Biomolecular Engineering. Group Leader of the Interfacial Chemical Engineering Laboratory.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="tl-dot" style="font-size:10px">OIST</div>
            <div class="tl-body">
              <p class="tl-year" style="position: relative;">2026 – 2026</p>
              <p class="tl-degree" style="position: relative;">Staff Scientist</p>
              <p class="tl-inst" style="position: relative;">Okinawa Institute of Science and Technology, Okinawa, Japan</p>
              <p class="tl-detail" style="position: relative;">Supporting the Droplet Laboratory (Dan Daniel).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="tl-dot" style="font-size:10px">AALTO</div>
            <div class="tl-body">
              <p class="tl-year" style="position: relative;">2022 – 2026</p>
              <p class="tl-degree" style="position: relative;">Marie-Curie (IF) / Research Council of Finland Research Fellow</p>
              <p class="tl-inst" style="position: relative;">Aalto University, Helsinki, Finland</p>
              <p class="tl-detail" style="position: relative;">Independent PI (Department of Applied Physics). Host: Prof. Robin Ras.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="tl-dot" style="font-size:10px">MPIP</div>
            <div class="tl-body">
